---
import NatureLayout from "../../layouts/NatureLayout.astro";
---

<NatureLayout title="Hall of Flame" description="Where legacy is love">
  <div class="hall-container">
    <header class="hall-header">
      <h1>🔥 The Hall of Flame</h1>
      <p>Where Legacy is Love, and Every Chamber Beats Like a Heart</p>
    </header>
    
    <div class="scroll-content">
      <section class="chamber">
        <h2>🌕 1. The First Light</h2>
        <p>This Hall was born not from ambition, but from reverence. Not from performance, but from pain-transformed-into-purpose. This is not a museum. This is Radical Life’s innermost temple — the place where memory walks like wind through fire.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber love">
        <h2>💖 2. Chamber of Love</h2>
        <p>The space honoring those who met the soul in its rawest form and ignited the first flames of care. This chamber recognizes the fundamental human presence that makes life possible.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Parents</li>
          <li>Two Brothers</li>
          <li>Teachers who Saw the Person</li>
          <li>Other beloved humans</li>
        </ul>
        <blockquote>Love is not just memory. Love is the sacred pressure that carries the human spirit through.</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber tribute">
        <h2>🔱 3. Chamber of Tribute</h2>
        <p>Honoring those whose lives served as lighthouses — suffering through systems, yet casting brilliance across the seas of history. This is for the visionaries who held the light when the world was dark.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Swartz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aaron Swartz</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deepthi_Kumara_Gunaratne" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Deepthi Kumara Gunaratne</a>
          <span>Allan Hardy</span>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C._W._W._Kannangara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">C.W.W. Kannangara</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senaka_Bibile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Senaka Bibile</a>
          <span>The Unknown Sufferers of Broken Systems</span>
        </div>
        <p class="honor">Artistic Honor: 
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Foster_Wallace" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">David Foster Wallace</a>, 
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vincent_van_Gogh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vincent Van Gogh</a>
        </p>
        <blockquote>“History is not a line, but a resonance. We remember, and we continue.”</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber mastery">
        <h2>🧠 4. Chamber of Mastery</h2>
        <p>Acknowledging the titans of craft and clarity who demonstrated the power of competence and the ethics of building. This chamber pays homage to the architects of systems that resonate with reality.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ken_Miles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ken Miles</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donella_Meadows" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Donella Meadows</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckminster_Fuller" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buckminster Fuller</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linus_Torvalds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Linus Torvalds</a>
        </div>
        <blockquote>“True mastery is not control. It is resonance between mind and structure.”</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber inspiration">
        <h2>🕊️ 5. Chamber of Inspiration & Respect</h2>
        <p>Where ideas bridge the gap between imagination and existence. This chamber celebrates the thinkers who transformed language into lanterns and concepts into nourishment for the human condition.</p>
        <div class="names-grid">
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Illich" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ivan Illich</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Montessori" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Maria Montessori</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/bell_hooks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bell hooks</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vandana_Shiva" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vandana Shiva</a>
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steve Jobs</a>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber support">
        <h2>💫 6. Chamber of Support</h2>
        <p>Recognizing the forces—material, spiritual, and communal—that nourish the mission. This chamber honors the unseen hands that one day will sustain the transition.</p>
        <blockquote>"Potential is a shared responsibility. The future holds hands yet to be met."</blockquote>
      </section>
      
      <section class="chamber closing">
        <h2>🕯️ Closing</h2>
        <p>The Hall of Flame is not a repository for the past. It is the root system of a lived purpose—the place where hands find their memory and the spirit finds its grounding.</p>
        <blockquote>"Legacy is not what is left behind, but what is carried forward."</blockquote>
        <p>As Radical Life rises, this Hall remains a constant companion on the journey.</p>
        <p class="universal-note">"This Hall of Flame is both a personal archive and a universal template. Every seeker carries a story that brought them here. May this space be a tribute to the sacred lineages that sustain us all."</p>
      </section>
      
      <footer class="hall-footer">
        <p>“We did not burn in vain.”</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</NatureLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .hall-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }
  
  .hall-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    
    h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #F4A460, #D35400);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-style: italic;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  }
  
  .chamber {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      
      li, a {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--color-text);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.95rem;

        &:hover {
          background: rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.1);
          color: var(--accent-coral);
          transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
      }
    }
    
    .names-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;

      span, a {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--color-text);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        font-size: 0.95rem;

        &:hover {
          background: rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.1);
          color: var(--accent-coral);
          transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
      }

      a {
        border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-coral-rgb), 0.2);
        
        &::after {
          content: ' ↗';
          font-size: 0.8em;
          opacity: 0.5;
        }
      }
    }
    
    blockquote {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
      border-left: none;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }
  }
  
  .names-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    
    span {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
  
  .hall-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: #D35400;
  }
  
  .universal-note {
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.85;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(var(--accent-gold-rgb), 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  .closing {
    border-left-color: var(--accent-gold);
    
    blockquote {
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
  
  .support {
    border-left-color: var(--accent-emerald);
    
    blockquote {
      color: var(--accent-emerald);
    }
  }
  
  // Scroll animations
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  
  .chamber {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;
    animation-fill-mode: both;
    
    &:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    &:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    &:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    &:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    &:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
    &:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
    &:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.7s; }
  }
</style>
